  "document": "Tom Dickinson\nThomas Eastwood Dickinson( 11 January 1931 – 25 June 2018) was an Australian- born first- class cricket player for Lancashire in 1950 and 1951 and for Somerset in 1957. But he decided against a full- time cricket career and became a schoolmaster. He was born in Parramatta, Sydney, Australia."
